   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Solid = happy path.   Dashed red = intentional skip.   Dashed green = pinned-sender bypass.\nPinned senders are allowlisted in emailwatcher.config; their mail skips pre-filter and the gate.\nOnly an unclaimed sender stops it reaching Notion. All outcomes appear in the completion report.",
